## Goals — Team

Join `goals.team_id` to `teams.team_id`. This is the team credited with the goal, including own goals; player_team_id identifies the scorer’s team. Use IDs for the join and name properties for readable results.

### Endpoint

| Source | Target | Type |
|--------|--------|------|
| worldcup_en_goals | worldcup_en_teams | direct |

### Mapping Rules

| Source Property | Target Property |
|-----------------|-----------------|
| team_id | team_id |
